    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Oh! Thank goodness you found me here! I need your help! 'Mysterious Magic' has swept through the whole kingdom! I'm stranded and my golden crown has gone missing! The kingdom needs a hero like you! Please rescue me!&quot;\u00a0</i>\u2014 <strong>Princess</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602610/extras/1764d452ea835239e4424138c3417202.poster.avif?t=1748991778\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602610/extras/1764d452ea835239e4424138c3417202.webm?t=1748991778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602610/extras/1764d452ea835239e4424138c3417202.mp4?t=1748991778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A<i><strong>\u00a0</strong></i>challenging grid-based puzzle adventure with cute pixel art graphics and dialog that at least attempts to be funny... It's a puzzle. It's a rescue. It's <i><strong>REZCUE</strong></i>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rescue the Princess </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level in <strong><i>REZCUE\u00a0</i></strong>requires you to\u00a0navigate a labyrinth<strong> </strong>to reach the princess!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smash Blocks </strong>-\u00a0Falling blocks can open up exciting new paths and possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge Danger</strong>\u00a0- Creatures of the kingdom that have been turned against you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles\u00a0</strong>- Each world introduces new and unique puzzle blocks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602610/extras/4e6cf20b00739bca0ebbffcdb8db194a.poster.avif?t=1748991778\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602610/extras/4e6cf20b00739bca0ebbffcdb8db194a.webm?t=1748991778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602610/extras/4e6cf20b00739bca0ebbffcdb8db194a.mp4?t=1748991778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the Kingdom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels in <i><strong>REZCUE</strong></i> have multiple solutions, but  the only way to truly lift the curse of the 'Mysterious Magic' is through perfect scores... obviously!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think Ahead </strong>-\u00a0Each step, fall, and smash counts as a move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Trophies</strong>\u00a0- Clear a level in the fewest moves possible to earn a golden trophy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lift the Spell</strong> - Collect all the trophies to restore peace to the kingdom!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And much much more...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tolerate the Chat\u00a0</strong>- Enjoy jokes, puns, and maybe even learn something after every level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tackle Challenges\u00a0</strong>- Only the best will unlock the 'Crowning Achievement'</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Secrets</strong> - Locate hidden Love Letters scattered throughout the kingdom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drink Love Potions</strong> - Stuck? Skip with a potion... the princess won't be happy though!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh... you're still here... that's awesome! Wishlist <i><strong>REZCUE</strong></i>\u00a0now and you'll be making the princess (and this solo indie developer) very happy!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Oh! Thank goodness you found me here! I need your help! 'Mysterious Magic' has swept through the whole kingdom! I'm stranded and my golden crown has gone missing! The kingdom needs a hero like you! Please rescue me!&quot;\u00a0</i>\u2014 <strong>Princess</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602610/extras/1764d452ea835239e4424138c3417202.poster.avif?t=1748991778\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602610/extras/1764d452ea835239e4424138c3417202.webm?t=1748991778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602610/extras/1764d452ea835239e4424138c3417202.mp4?t=1748991778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A<i><strong>\u00a0</strong></i>challenging grid-based puzzle adventure with cute pixel art graphics and dialog that at least attempts to be funny... It's a puzzle. It's a rescue. It's <i><strong>REZCUE</strong></i>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rescue the Princess </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level in <strong><i>REZCUE\u00a0</i></strong>requires you to\u00a0navigate a labyrinth<strong> </strong>to reach the princess!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smash Blocks </strong>-\u00a0Falling blocks can open up exciting new paths and possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge Danger</strong>\u00a0- Creatures of the kingdom that have been turned against you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles\u00a0</strong>- Each world introduces new and unique puzzle blocks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602610/extras/4e6cf20b00739bca0ebbffcdb8db194a.poster.avif?t=1748991778\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602610/extras/4e6cf20b00739bca0ebbffcdb8db194a.webm?t=1748991778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602610/extras/4e6cf20b00739bca0ebbffcdb8db194a.mp4?t=1748991778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the Kingdom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels in <i><strong>REZCUE</strong></i> have multiple solutions, but  the only way to truly lift the curse of the 'Mysterious Magic' is through perfect scores... obviously!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think Ahead </strong>-\u00a0Each step, fall, and smash counts as a move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Trophies</strong>\u00a0- Clear a level in the fewest moves possible to earn a golden trophy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lift the Spell</strong> - Collect all the trophies to restore peace to the kingdom!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And much much more...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tolerate the Chat\u00a0</strong>- Enjoy jokes, puns, and maybe even learn something after every level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tackle Challenges\u00a0</strong>- Only the best will unlock the 'Crowning Achievement'</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Secrets</strong> - Locate hidden Love Letters scattered throughout the kingdom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drink Love Potions</strong> - Stuck? Skip with a potion... the princess won't be happy though!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh... you're still here... that's awesome! Wishlist <i><strong>REZCUE</strong></i>\u00a0now and you'll be making the princess (and this solo indie developer) very happy!</p>",
